  SNYK-JS-IMAGESIZE-17295814:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          Dev-time-only mobile tooling. image-size@1.2.1: metro@latest still
          pins image-size ^1.0.2 and 1.2.1 is the last 1.x (fix only in 2.0.x,
          outside metro's range). uuid@7.0.3: xcode@3.0.1 (latest) pins uuid
          ^7.0.3; next fixed versions 11.1.1/14.0.0 are ESM-only and break
          xcode's CJS require. Neither ships inside the app bundle (metro
          bundler + expo prebuild only). Tracked upstream for a patched
          image-size 1.x / metro range change and a CJS-compatible uuid or xcode
          dep update.
        expires: 2027-08-05T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-08-05T08:34:36.974Z
